&lt;li&gt;The VideoLAN Forums: &lt;a class=&quot;external&quot; rel=&quot;external&quot; href=&quot;https://forum.videolan.org/viewtopic.php?t=144476&quot;&gt;How to Enable hiDPI Scaling?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;bgstack15.wordpress.com: &lt;a class=&quot;external&quot; rel=&quot;external&quot; href=&quot;https://bgstack15.wordpress.com/2019/04/11/fix-vlc-ui-scaling-problems/&quot;&gt;Fix vlc ui scaling problems&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unix &amp;amp; Linux Stack Exchange: &lt;a class=&quot;external&quot; rel=&quot;external&quot; href=&quot;https://unix.stackexchange.com/questions/557181/how-to-increase-dpi-for-vlc-media-player-in-cinnamon-on-uhd-display&quot;&gt;How to increase DPI for VLC media player in Cinnamon on UHD display?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
